        "venceu_blocos": [
          "Last one standing is you. The whole pit saw it.",
          "Nato walks in hard, takes the book and tears it page by page in your face.",
          "«You're clean with me. Get lost.»",
          "They blindfold you again. You wake up on some corner of the Strip — body aching, name back to zero."
