        "venceu_titulo": "YOU WALKED OUT WHOLE",
        "venceu_texto": "Last one standing is you. The crowd's still screaming when Nato steps into the pit, takes the book and tears it page by page in your face. \"You're clean with me.\" They blindfold you again. You wake up on a corner of the Strip, body aching, name back to zero.",
        "venceu_texto_grana": "Last one standing is you. Nato counts 200 into your hand, dry, without looking at you — business is business. You got nothing else: nobody leaves the pit smarter, just more marked up. They blindfold you, dump you on the Strip with a heavy pocket.",
